<resources>
    <string name="lid_observation_title">Lid observation (experimental)</string>
    <string name="lid_observation_summary">Collect a 30-second, opt-in BLE sample to investigate AirPods 5 lid events. This does not enable a popup.</string>
    <string name="lid_observation_instructions">Start with the case closed. Mark it closed, open it and mark it open, then close and mark again. Wait a few seconds between actions. Do not reset, unpair, or change firmware.</string>
    <string name="lid_observation_privacy">Nearby-device permission is required only for this debug tool. Candidates are not authenticated as your headphones. No addresses, names, keys, or opaque payload tails are exported. Data stays in memory; copy before leaving. Closing this panel or backgrounding the app stops scanning. Platform filtering can hide advertisements, so no observations do not prove incompatibility.</string>
